    "regime_notes": "20D IC remained positive in 2027-2030 (0.03348; 370 dates) and 2031-2034 (0.03904; 334 dates), but weakened in 2035 YTD (0.00927; 31 dates). Small 15-asset universe implies conservative interpretation.",
    "signal_artifact": "scripts/miner_3_20350611_dispersion_impulse_signal.csv"
